OL,3,APoundland set for more time to secure a
OL,4,Arescue deal as emergency talks continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland looks set to avoid immediate
OL,7,Fcollapse after its US owners told MPs
OL,8,Fon Wednesday they were in favour of
OL,9,Fextending a deadline to find a rescue
OL,10,Fdeal.
OL,12,FThe discount chain, which has 11,000
OL,13,Femployees, has been edging towards
OL,14,Fadministration after being blocked by
OL,15,FGordon Brothers from accessing cash in
OL,16,Fits bank accounts.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
